@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### 1. List Active Deadlines
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deadlines/active
Accept: application/json

### 2. List Completed Deadlines
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deadlines/completed
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create a Deadline (Future Due Date)
# @name createDeadline
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deadlines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Tax Filing",
  "shortDescription": "2025 Returns",
  "longDescription": "Remember to gather W-2s, 1099s, and deduction receipts before submission.",
  "dueAt": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### 4. Create Deadline Validation Error (Past Due Date)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deadlines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Past Deadline Should Fail",
  "dueAt": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### 5. Get Deadline by ID
@deadlineId = 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deadlines/{{deadlineId}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Change Due Date (Past Date Allowed)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/deadlines/{{deadlineId}}/due-date
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dueAt": "2026-11-15T12:00:00Z"
}

### 7. Mark Deadline Complete
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deadlines/{{deadlineId}}/complete
Accept: application/json

### 8. Mark Deadline Complete Again (Conflict - Expect 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deadlines/{{deadlineId}}/complete
Accept: application/json

### 9. Restore Deadline to Active
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deadlines/{{deadlineId}}/restore
Accept: application/json

### 10. Restore Already Active Deadline (Conflict - Expect 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deadlines/{{deadlineId}}/restore
Accept: application/json

### 11. Delete Deadline
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/deadlines/{{deadlineId}}

### 12. Get Urgency Settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings
Accept: application/json

### 13. Update Settings (Valid)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "redThresholdHours": 48,
  "yellowThresholdHours": 120
}

### 14. Update Settings (Invalid - Red >= Yellow)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "redThresholdHours": 72,
  "yellowThresholdHours": 24
}
